hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"109","[AI-translation] Dono hatheliyan jode, un mein halka phunke aur un mein Surah Al-Ikhlas, Al-Falaq aur An-Naas padhe; phir un se jism par jahan tak ho sake phere, sar, chehre aur jism ke agle hisse se shuru kare. [Yeh teen bar kare.] [Sone se pehle padhe]"
"110","[AI-translation] Allah; us ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh zinda hai, qayam rakhne wala hai; use oongh-neend nahin pakadti. Aasmanon-zameen mein jo hai usi ka hai. Us ki ijazat ke baghair us ke pas kaun sifarish karega? Un ke aage-peeche jo hai woh janta hai; us ke ilm mein se kuch nahin gherte—woh jo chahe us ke siwa. Us ki kursi aasmanon-zameen ko ghere hai; un ki hifazat use thakati nahin; woh buland, Azeem hai. [Aayatul-Kursi; sone se pehle padhe]"
"111","[AI-translation] Rasul iman laya us par jo us ke Rab ki taraf se us par nazil hua, aur momin bhi. Sab Allah par, us ke farishton par, us ki kitabon par aur us ke rasulon par iman lae. Hum us ke rasulon mein se kisi ke darmiyan farq nahin karte. Aur unhon ne kaha: Hum ne suna aur ata'at ki; teri maghfirat [mange hain], ae hamare Rab; teri hi taraf lautna hai. Allah kisi jaan par us ki taqat se zyada bojh nahin dalta; us ke liye hai jo us ne kamaya aur us par hai jo us ne kiya. Ae hamare Rab! Agar hum bhulein ya khata karein to hamari pakad na kar. Ae hamare Rab! Hum par aisa bojh na daal jaisa hum se pehlon par dala. Ae hamare Rab! Hum par woh na laad jis ki hum mein taqat nahin; aur hum se darguzar kar, hamein bakhsh de, hum par raham kar; Tu hamara Mawla hai; kafir qaum ke muqable hamari madad kar. [surah Al-Baqarah:285-286; sone se pehle padhe]"
"112","[AI-translation] Tere naam se, ae mere Rab, main ne pehlu [bistar par] rakha, aur Tere sath uthata hun; agar Tu meri ruh rok le to us par raham kar; aur agar Tu use chhod de to us ki hifazat kar jis se Tu apne nek bandon ki hifazat karta hai."
"113","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tune meri ruh paida ki aur Tu use wafat dega; us ki maut aur zindagi tere liye hai; agar Tu use zinda rakhe to us ki hifazat kar, aur agar Tu use maut de to use bakhsh de. Ae Allah! Main Tujhse aafiyat mangta hun."
"114","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Jis din Tu apne bandon ko uthayega mujhe apne azab se bacha. [Teen bar padhe]"
"115","[AI-translation] Tere naam se, ae Allah, marta hun aur jeeta hun."
"116","[AI-translation] Allah pak hai [taintees bar], tareef Allah ke liye hai [taintees bar], Allah sab se bada hai [chauntees bar]. [Sone se pehle padhe]"
"117","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Saat aasmanon ke Rab, zameen ke Rab aur arshe-azeem ke Rab; hamare Rab aur har cheez ke Rab; dane aur guthli ko cheerhne wale; Taurat, Injeel aur Furqan nazil karne wale! Har cheez ke shar se teri panah chahta hun jis ki peshani Tune pakdi hai. Ae Allah! Tu Awwal hai; Tujhse pehle kuch na tha; Tu Aakhir hai; Tere baad kuch na hoga; Tu Zahir hai; Tujhse upar kuch nahin; Tu Batin hai; Tujhse neeche [Tujhse chhipa] kuch nahin; hamara qarz ada kar de aur hamein faqr se ghani kar de."
"118","[AI-translation] Sari tareefein us Allah ke liye hain, jis ne hamein khilaya aur pilaya, hamein kafi hua aur hamein thikana diya; aur kitne hain jinhein na kafayat hai na thikana."
"119","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Ghaib-hazir ke janne wale, aasmanon-zameen ke paida karne wale, har cheez ke Rab aur malik! Main gawahi deta hun ke tere siwa koi mabud nahin; apne nafs ke shar se, shaitan aur us ke jaal ke shar se, apne upar burai karne ya kisi musalman tak pahunchane se teri panah chahta hun. [Sone se pehle padhe]"
"120","[AI-translation] Surah As-Sajdah [surah 32] aur Surah Al-Mulk [surah 67] padhe. [Sone se pehle padhe]"
"121","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main ne apni jaan tere supurd ki, apna kaam tere supurd kiya, apna chehra teri taraf kiya, apni peeth teri taraf lagao; teri [rahmat ki] raghbat aur tere [azab ke] khauf ke sath; Tujhse na koi panah hai na najaat magar teri taraf; main teri kitab par iman laya jo Tune nazil ki aur tere Nabi par jo Tune bheja. [Sone se pehle padhe; yeh us raat ka aakhri kalam ho]"
